      "text": "With one attack, the Hono can finish Hi, Hono, Kagari, Radi, Umeme, Kimubunga, Sjor, Göl, Gölge, Karanlık, Muju, Sachita, Sachakuna, Yan and Mazask. Every unlit card survives that single hit."
