      "text": "With one attack, the Kagari can finish Hi, Hono, Kagari, Radi, Umeme, Kimubunga, Sjor, Straumr, Göl, Gölge, Karanlık, Muju, Sachita, Sachakuna, Yan, Mazask and Tanka. Every unlit card survives that single hit."
